        <mxCell id="kZwhHGzqvlMfPyiFF4_c-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. CAP theorem: AP System, availablility &amp;gt;&amp;gt; consistency. Expectation is data to be eventually consistent within 1 minute&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2. 500 ms latency for both posting and viewing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Should be scalable to handle 2 billion DAU (that&#39;s comparable to real Facebook scale )&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
